OL,3,GNEWSAFishermen seek urgent help with
OL,4,Asoaring fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Defra spokesperson said: "This
OL,7,Fgovernment is helping our vital fishing
OL,8,Findustry by providing tax relief on
OL,9,Ffuel, alongside #360m to support its
OL,10,Fdevelopment through our Fishing and
OL,11,FCoastal Growth Fund."
